<title>CHINA: HK June provisional trade deficit HK$12.7 bln.</title>
<headline>HK June provisional trade deficit HK$12.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$12.7 billion in June.</p>
<p>(Rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			   June '97     May '97	 June '96</p>
<p>Trade balance	    -12.7	 -17.52	   -15.02</p>
<p>Domestic Exports	  17.9	  16.83	    16.90</p>
<p> Re-exports		101.1	 100.17	    91.88</p>
<p>Total exports	    119.0	 117.00	   108.78</p>
<p>Imports		    131.7	 134.53	   123.80</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year ended:</p>
<p>			   June '97     May '97	 June '96</p>
<p>Trade balance	   -150.39     -152.73	  -142.62</p>
<p>Domestic Exports	 208.77	207.76	   222.85</p>
<p> Re-exports	    1,210.08     1,200.82	1,148.12</p>
<p>Total exports	  1,418.85     1,408.58	1,370.96</p>
<p>Imports		  1,569.23     1,561.31	1,513.58</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
